    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MyClipboard </strong>is a powerful, lightweight, silent and user-friendly Windows clipboard manager that gives you full control over your copied content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Access your clipboard history instantly and stay organized</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Access with Shortcuts:</strong> Open the app anytime using a customizable keyboard shortcut to quickly retrieve previous clipboard items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Clipboard History:</strong> Automatically display copied text, images, files and more in a clean, organized interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favorites System:</strong> Pin important clipboard items to access them instantly anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search Functionality:</strong> Easily search through your clipboard history to find exactly what you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacklist System:</strong> Exclude specific apps or content types from being saved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source Provider Tracking:</strong> Instantly see where each clipboard item originated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Image Editor:</strong> Edit copied images directly within the app</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipboard Backup:</strong> Securely save and restore your clipboard history</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MyClipboard </strong>is a powerful, lightweight, silent and user-friendly Windows clipboard manager that gives you full control over your copied content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Access your clipboard history instantly and stay organized</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Access with Shortcuts:</strong> Open the app anytime using a customizable keyboard shortcut to quickly retrieve previous clipboard items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Clipboard History:</strong> Automatically display copied text, images, files and more in a clean, organized interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favorites System:</strong> Pin important clipboard items to access them instantly anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search Functionality:</strong> Easily search through your clipboard history to find exactly what you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacklist System:</strong> Exclude specific apps or content types from being saved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source Provider Tracking:</strong> Instantly see where each clipboard item originated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Image Editor:</strong> Edit copied images directly within the app</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipboard Backup:</strong> Securely save and restore your clipboard history</p></li></ul>",
